# This project's real toolchain is npm (package-lock.json is the
# committed lockfile) - bun is only used locally in dev environments
# without a real Node.js/npm install available, to verify the same
# package.json resolves and the same scripts run. Its own lockfile format
# is bun-specific and shouldn't coexist as a second source of truth.
bun.lock
bun.lockb
